        By the end of this learning path, you will be able to:
      </p>

      <div class="objectives-grid">
        <div class="objective-card"><strong>Explain</strong> how a growth mindset and a focus on 1% improvement support continuous development in coaching practice.</div>
        <div class="objective-card"><strong>Demonstrate</strong> appropriate responses to constructive feedback by listening openly, seeking clarification, and identifying actionable takeaways.</div>
        <div class="objective-card"><strong>Create</strong> a self-guided development plan that translates feedback into specific actions, practice opportunities, and measures of progress.</div>
        <div class="objective-card"><strong>Use</strong> team and leadership support by intentionally asking for guidance, resources, feedback, or additional perspective.</div>
