    <div class="section-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Your Development Journey</p>
      <h2 class="section-heading">Learning Path</h2>
      <p class="lead">
        This learning path is designed to unfold over time. Some steps require a meeting,
        an observation, practice in real coaching interactions, or follow-up before the next
        step becomes available.
      </p>

      <div class="path-grid">
        <article class="path-card" id="path-card-1">
          <span class="path-number">1</span>
          <h3>Embracing Feedback</h3>
          <p>Work through short, click-through content on 1% improvement, mindset, and feedback responses.</p>
